  "question": {
    "text": "If both the mean and the standard deviation of <math><mn>50</mn></math> observations <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></msub></math> are equal to <math><mn>16</mn></math>, then the mean of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is",
